    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents 10 The Willows, Dunstaffnage Hall, a bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment enjoying a desirable west-facing aspect within this mature and highly regarded Stillorgan development. Positioned on the second floor, both the living space and bedroom benefit from excellent afternoon and evening light, a B energy rating while a designated parking space adds to the convenience of this appealing property.\r\n\r\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, generous living/dining room with a pleasant outlook, separate fitted kitchen, spacious double bedroom and bathroom. The apartment offers comfortable, easily managed accommodation and represents an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor.\r\n\r\nDunstaffnage Hall is a particularly attractive, low-density development set within beautifully maintained landscaped grounds. Extensive lawns, mature trees and established planting create a peaceful, almost parkland setting, despite its exceptionally convenient location. Secure electric gates provide additional privacy and security, while the mature nature of the development gives it a character and sense of space not always found in more recently built schemes. The development was completed in 1999 on the former grounds of Dunstaffnage House.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Stillorgan Village and Stillorgan Shopping Centre within easy reach, providing an extensive choice of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. The area is exceptionally well connected, with frequent public transport services providing convenient access to Dublin city centre, UCD and the surrounding south Dublin suburbs.\r\n\r\nA bright, well-proportioned apartment with parking in one of Stillorgan's most established and appealing residential developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living / Dining area (6.22m x 3.20m)\r\nBright and spacious open-plan living and dining area featuring dual windows overlooking the communal gardens, hardwood flooring and direct access to the kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.76m x 1.74m)\r\nWell-appointed kitchen with tiled flooring and splashback, Bosch four-ring electric hob, Zanussi dishwasher and Indesit washing machine.\r\n\r\nBedroom (4.45m x 2.70m)\r\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom with hardwood flooring and excellent integrated wardrobe storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.40m x 1.66m max)\r\nFully tiled bathroom comprising a wash hand basin with under-sink storage, WC and bath with overhead shower.\r\n\r\nHallway (5.17m x 1.58m)\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with hardwood flooring, intercom and access to all rooms within the apartment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment.\r\nSecond-floor setting into a quiet courtyard.\r\nB energy rating.\r\nSituated within a mature, low-density gated development.\r\nSecure electric gates providing privacy and security.\r\nBeautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens.\r\nWest-facing windows to living room and bedroom.\r\nExcellent afternoon and evening natural light.\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\nWell managed development.\r\nHighly convenient location close to Stillorgan Village and excellent transport links."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
